      ],
      "image": "assets/images/246202/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Heat butter in a stockpot over medium heat. Add mushrooms, bok choy, green onions, garlic, and ginger. Sprinkle mushroom mixture with lime juice, then cook and stir just until lightly browned, 2 to 3 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/TzXEV-WAd7zX4wlXkW5HjOsevvE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-246202-mushroom-bok-choy-soup-VAT-step-02-ad01b40e9e7948bebb3c225416d85d01.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/246202/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Increase the heat to medium-high. Pour in chicken broth and bring to a boil. Reduce the heat to low and simmer until vegetables are soft, about 5 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/cQlnmTM7SPhjhaHIImvkjQWjdaM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-246202-mushroom-bok-choy-soup-VAT-step-03-8661bc1e8a9e4d21a61b59e7d9a3d31d.jpg"
